abstract: "Cross-sectional ecological analysis of NHIS non-enrolment across 261 Ghana administrative districts integrating PHC 2021, DHS 2019/2022, and administrative records. Spatial clustering (Moran's I=0.461), GWR (mean local R²=0.624), and ensemble ML (RF AUC-ROC=0.918) identify poverty incidence as the dominant determinant and women's NHIS coverage as a protective factor."
